        "id": 54558,
        "name": "pwatson1974",
        "username": "pwatson1974",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-10T08:18:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You can only have one copy of each card with the Limited keyword in play but apart from that there is no limit. Nor is there a theoretical limit on handsize.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If the card has Power on it, you can only use 1 power per turn, unless you've got cards saying otherwise, but that can be any power you have in play, inlcuding your hero card power. If the card is not a power, you get the benefits all the time, i.e. you don't have to choose to activate Inspiring Presence, it's just there.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:29:02.640Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 7312,
        "topic_slug": "first-time-player-with-a-question",
        "display_username": "pwatson1974",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
