        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>You can only have one copy of each card with the Limited keyword in play but apart from that there is no limit. Nor is there a theoretical limit on handsize.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If the card has Power on it, you can only use 1 power per turn, unless you&#39;ve got cards saying otherwise, but that can be any power you have in play, inlcuding your hero card power. If the card is not a power, you get the benefits all the time, i.e. you don&#39;t have to choose to activate Inspiring Presence, it&#39;s just there.</p>",
